artin\"><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"イタリア語の受動態を例とインタラクティブな演習で学びます。\"><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://italianoconmartin.com/ja/bunpo/c1/イタリア語の受動態.html\"><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://italianoconmartin.com/assets/social-card.svg\"><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"イタリア語の受動態 | イタリア語文法 C1 | Italiano con Martin\"><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"イタリア語の受動態を例とインタラクティブな演習で学びます。\"><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://italianoconmartin.com/assets/social-card.svg\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../../../styles.css\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../../../assets/grammar-lesson.css\"><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"../../../favicon.png\" type=\"image/png\"><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"../../../apple-touch-icon.png\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"LearningResource\",\"name\":\"イタリア語の受動態\",\"url\":\"https://italianoconmartin.com/ja/bunpo/c1/イタリア語の受動態.html\",\"inLanguage\":\"ja\"}</script></head><body data-lesson=\"martin-passiva-c1\"><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"container nav-wrap\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/ja/\"><img class=\"brand-avatar\" src=\"../../../assets/martin-photo.svg\" alt=\"Martin\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" decoding=\"async\"><span>Italiano con Martin</span></a><details class=\"language-switcher\"><summary aria-label=\"Language\"><span class=\"language-flag\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🇯🇵</span><span class=\"language-current\">日本語</span><span class=\"language-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⌄</span></summary><div class=\"language-options\"><a href=\"/grammatica/c1/forma-passiva.html\" hreflang=\"it\" lang=\"it\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇮🇹</span><span>Italiano</span></a><a href=\"/en/grammar/c1/italian-passive-voice.html\" hreflang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇬🇧</span><span>English</span></a><a href=\"/es/gramatica/c1/la-voz-pasiva-en-italiano.html\" hreflang=\"es\" lang=\"es\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇪🇸</span><span>Español</span></a><a href=\"/fr/grammaire/c1/la-voix-passive-en-italien.html\" hreflang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇫🇷</span><span>Français</span></a><a href=\"/cs/gramatika/c1/trpny-rod-v-italstine.html\" hreflang=\"cs\" lang=\"cs\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇨🇿</span><span>Čeština</span></a><a href=\"/pl/gramatyka/c1/strona-bierna-po-wlosku.html\" hreflang=\"pl\" lang=\"pl\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇵🇱</span><span>Polski</span></a><a href=\"/tr/dilbilgisi/c1/italyanca-edilgen-yapi.html\" hreflang=\"tr\" lang=\"tr\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇹🇷</span><span>Türkçe</span></a><a href=\"/de/grammatik/c1/passiv-im-italienischen.html\" hreflang=\"de\" lang=\"de\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇩🇪</span><span>Deutsch</span></a><a href=\"/ja/bunpo/c1/イタリア語の受動態.html\" hreflang=\"ja\" lang=\"ja\" aria-current=\"page\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇯🇵</span><span>日本語</span></a></div></details><nav><a href=\"/ja/bunpo/\">文法</a><a href=\"/ja/dokkai/\">測定値</a><a href=\"/ja/goi/\">語彙</a><a class=\"about-link\" href=\"/ja/watashitachi-ni-tsuite/\">私たちについて</a><a class=\"nav-cta\" href=\"https://preply.com/it/tutor/5086125\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Preplyで予約する</a></nav></div></header><main><section class=\"page-intro\"><div class=\"container lesson-shell\"><p class=\"breadcrumbs\"><a href=\"/ja/\">ホーム</a> / <a href=\"/ja/bunpo/\">文法</a> / C1 / イタリア語の受動態</p><p class=\"eyebrow\">文法C1</p><h1>イタリア語の受動態</h1><p class=\"lead\">行動から、それを誰が、あるいは何を受け取るか、つまり本が出版され、法律が可決されることに注意を移すことを学びましょう。</p><div class=\"lesson-nav\"><a href=\"#regola\">ルール</a><a href=\"#tabella\">テーブル</a><a href=\"#esempi\">例</a><a href=\"#esercizi\">演習</a></div><div class=\"pdf-downloads\" aria-label=\"PDF downloads\"><a class=\"button secondary\" href=\"/pdf/ja/イタリア語の受動態-c1.pdf\" download=\"\">PDF C1</a></div></div></section><section class=\"section compact-top\"><div class=\"container lesson-shell\"><article class=\"lesson-box\" id=\"regola\"><h2>受動態って何ですか？</h2><p>能動文では主語が動作を実行します。受動的な文では、主語が動作を受け取ります。これは、正式な文書、ニュース、指示、文書などで頻繁に使用されます。</p><div class=\"example-grid\"><div class=\"example\"><strong>Attiva</strong><br>Il Comune approva il progetto.</div><div class=\"example\"><strong>Passiva</strong><br>Il progetto è approvato dal Comune.</div><div class=\"example\"><strong>Attiva</strong><br>L'editore ha pubblicato il libro.</div><div class=\"example\"><strong>Passiva</strong><br>Il libro è stato pubblicato dall'editore.</div></div></article><article class=\"lesson-box\" id=\"tabella\"><h2>主な形式</h2><table class=\"conj-table\"><thead><tr><th>Forma</th><th>Uso</th><th>Esempio</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>essere + participio</td><td>forma generale</td><td>La porta è chiusa.</td></tr><tr><td>venire + participio</td><td>azione, non stato</td><td>La domanda viene controllata.</td></tr><tr><td>andare + participio</td><td>necessità</td><td>Il modulo va compilato.</td></tr><tr><td>da + agente</td><td>chi compie l'azione</td><td>Il film è diretto da Fellini.</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"mini-note\"><strong>同意:</strong> 分詞は受動態主語に同意します: 手紙は書かれ、文書は署名されました。</p></article><article class=\"lesson-box\" id=\"esempi\"><h2>正式な例と自然な例</h2><div class=\"example-grid\"><div class=\"example\">La riunione è stata rimandata.</div><div class=\"example\">I risultati verranno pubblicati domani.</div><div class=\"example\">Il documento va firmato entro venerdì.</div><div class=\"example\">Le richieste sono state analizzate con attenzione.</div></div></article><article class=\"lesson-box\"><h2>よくある間違い</h2><div class=\"mistake-grid\"><div class=\"mistake\"><strong>Non: la lettera è scritto</strong>Ma: la lettera è scritta.</div><div class=\"mistake\"><strong>Non: il libro è pubblicato da ieri</strong>Meglio: il libro è stato pubblicato ieri.</div><div class=\"mistake\"><strong>Non: viene chiuso da me la porta</strong>Ma: la porta viene chiusa da me.</div><div class=\"mistake\"><strong>Non: il modulo deve compilato</strong>Ma: il modulo va compilato / deve essere compilato.</div></div></article><article class=\"lesson-box\" id=\"esercizi\"><h2>すぐにフィードバックが得られる演習</h2><p>受動態文を変換または完成させます。</p><div id=\"exercise-list\"><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"è firmato\" data-hint=\"文書は男性単数形です。\"><label>1. Il documento ___ dal direttore.</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"è stata scritta\" data-hint=\"手紙は女性単数形です: 書かれました。\"><label>2. La lettera ___ da Anna.</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"sono stati pubblicati\" data-hint=\"結果は男性複数形になります。\"><label>3. I risultati ___ ieri.</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"viene controllata\" data-hint=\"質問は女性単数です。\"><label>4. La domanda ___ ogni giorno.</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"va compilato\" data-hint=\"Go + 分詞は必然性を示します。\"><label>5. Il modulo ___ online.</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"dal\" data-hint=\"＋から＝から。\"><label>6. Il progetto è approvato ___ Comune.</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"dalla\" data-hint=\"から＋ラ＝から。\"><label>7. La canzone è cantata ___ studentessa.</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"sono state chiuse\" data-hint=\"ドア：女性の複数形。\"><label>8. Le porte ___ alle otto.</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"è stato costruito\" data-hint=\"橋：男性単数形。\"><label>9. Il ponte ___ nel 1990.</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"devono essere inviati\" data-hint=\"文書は男性複数形です。\"><label>10. I documenti ___ entro domani.</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div></div><div class=\"score-card\"><div><strong>あなたの結果</strong><p id=\"score-text\">10 問中 0 問正解</p></div><strong id=\"score-percent\">0%</strong></div><div class=\"exercise-actions\"><button class=\"reset-btn\" id=\"reset-exercises\" type=\"button\">もう一度始める</button><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://preply.com/it/tutor/5086125\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">マーティンと一緒にトレーニングする</a></div></article></div></section><section class=\"conversion-section teacher-cta-section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"teacher-cta-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Italiano con Martin</p><h2>一緒にイタリア語を学ぶ先生を選ぶ</h2></div><p>二人の先生、二つの視点。興味に合った学び方を選べます。</p></div><div class=\"teacher-cta-options\"><article class=\"teacher-cta\"><img src=\"../../../assets/martin-portrait.webp\" alt=\"Martin\" width=\"800\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div><strong>Martin</strong><span>科学・テクノロジー・語源</span></div><a class=\"button light\" href=\"https://preply.com/it/tutor/5086125\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Martinと学ぶ</a></article><article class=\"teacher-cta\"><img src=\"../../../assets/licia-portrait.webp\" alt=\"Licia\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div><strong>Licia</strong><span>芸術・忍耐・文法</span></div><a class=\"button light\" href=\"https://preply.in/LICIA6IT2176799611?ts=17865248\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Liciaと学ぶ</a></article></div><div class=\"teacher-cta-links\"><a href=\"/ja/watashitachi-ni-tsuite/\">MartinとLiciaについて</a><a href=\"https://wa.me/59167434075?text=Martin%E3%81%BE%E3%81%9F%E3%81%AFLicia%E3%81%AE%E3%82%A4%E3%82%BF%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E8%AA%9E%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%82%B9%E3%83%B3%E3%81%AB%E3%81%A4%E3%81%84%E3%81%A6%E7%9F%A5%E3%82%8A%E3%81%9F%E3%81%84%E3%81%A7%E3%81%99%E3%80%82\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WhatsAppで相談</a></div></div></section></main><footer><div class=\"container footer-grid\"><div><strong>Italiano con Martin</strong><p>明確な文法、段階別のリーディング、オンライン レッスン。</p></div><div><a href=\"/ja/bunpo/\">文法</a><a href=\"/ja/dokkai/\">測定値</a><a href=\"/ja/goi/\">語彙</a><a class=\"about-link\" href=\"/ja/watashitachi-ni-tsuite/\">私たちについて</a></div></div></footer><script src=\"../../../assets/grammar-exercises.js\"></script><script src=\"../../../script.js\"></script>\n</body></html>";
